- `multiplyMatrices`: Multiplies two 2x2 matrices under modulo p.
- `matrixPower`: Raises a 2x2 matrix to the power of n under modulo p using exponentiation by squaring.
- `fibonacciMod`: Uses these helper functions to compute the nth Fibonacci number modulo p efficiently.

